Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.06,0:00:00.49,Caption,,0,0,0,,Why does this
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.50,0:00:01.43,Caption,,0,0,0,,bridge peel trucks
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.44,0:00:01.83,Caption,,0,0,0,,open like
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.84,0:00:02.29,Caption,,0,0,0,,a can?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.55,0:00:03.04,Caption,,0,0,0,,It's a rail
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.05,0:00:04.29,Caption,,0,0,0,,bridge, only eleven
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.30,0:00:04.88,Caption,,0,0,0,,foot eight.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.14,0:00:05.66,Caption,,0,0,0,,So a steel
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.67,0:00:06.34,Caption,,0,0,0,,beam out front
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.35,0:00:07.15,Caption,,0,0,0,,takes the hits,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.38,0:00:08.14,Caption,,0,0,0,,not the bridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.40,0:00:08.87,Caption,,0,0,0,,And a truck
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.88,0:00:10.04,Caption,,0,0,0,,roof is aluminum
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.05,0:00:10.57,Caption,,0,0,0,,thinner than
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.58,0:00:10.99,Caption,,0,0,0,,a dime.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.25,0:00:11.47,Caption,,0,0,0,,So the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.49,0:00:12.25,Caption,,0,0,0,,steel wins.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.69,0:00:13.46,Caption,,0,0,0,,The rivets pop
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.61,0:00:14.08,Caption,,0,0,0,,and the roof
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.09,0:00:14.86,Caption,,0,0,0,,peels back.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.12,0:00:15.65,Caption,,0,0,0,,The cab is
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.66,0:00:16.63,Caption,,0,0,0,,lower, so the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.64,0:00:17.31,Caption,,0,0,0,,truck keeps
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.33,0:00:18.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,rolling under.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.26,0:00:18.81,Caption,,0,0,0,,This one is
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.82,0:00:20.49,Caption,,0,0,0,,thirteen feet, sixteen
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.50,0:00:21.35,Caption,,0,0,0,,inches too tall.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.61,0:00:22.27,Caption,,0,0,0,,Now a sensor
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.28,0:00:23.43,Caption,,0,0,0,,spots tall trucks
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.58,0:00:24.14,Caption,,0,0,0,,and turns the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.15,0:00:24.75,Caption,,0,0,0,,light red.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.01,0:00:26.01,Caption,,0,0,0,,In twenty nineteen,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.33,0:00:27.06,Caption,,0,0,0,,they even raised
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.08,0:00:27.62,Caption,,0,0,0,,the bridge
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.78,0:00:28.52,Caption,,0,0,0,,eight inches.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.78,0:00:29.46,Caption,,0,0,0,,Trucks still hit
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.47,0:00:30.08,Caption,,0,0,0,,it, just
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.09,0:00:30.66,Caption,,0,0,0,,less often.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.92,0:00:31.31,Caption,,0,0,0,,That's why they
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.32,0:00:31.72,Caption,,0,0,0,,call it the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.73,0:00:32.34,Caption,,0,0,0,,can opener.
